* ADR1399H precision reference buffered by LTC6078
.include ADR1399H.lib
.include LTC6078.lib

* Primary supply input
VIN IN 0 DC 15

* Floating 5 V supply for the LTC6078
VOP VDD 0 DC 9.5
VOM VSS 0 DC 4.5
CDD VDD VSS 1u

* ADR1399H: VREF, reference ground, heater+, heater-
XREF REF 0 IN 0 ADR1399H
RBIAS IN REF 2.67k
CREF REF 0 1u

* LTC6078: noninverting input, inverting input, V+, V-, output
XBUF REF OUT VDD VSS OUT LTC6078

* Required 1 k load
RLOAD OUT 0 1k

.tran 0 20 0 10m startup
.meas tran vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 19 TO 20

.end
